{"id":"wb-7-403","name":"重庆冶锌遗址群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"重慶冶鋅遺址群","text":"重庆冶锌遗址群位于重庆市酆都县、石砫县、忠县、酉阳县等多处地方，文物遗址年代为明、清，2009年12月15日列为第二批重庆市文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n目前重庆境内发现的冶锌遗址分布在三大片区：\n\n丰都县沿江片区：丰都县至忠县长江两岸的台地上；\n石柱县齐曜山片区：丰都县武坪镇至石柱县，沿齐曜山呈东北-西南方向分布；\n酉阳县乌江片区：分布在乌江右岸的一些山包上。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8D%E6%85%B6%E5%86%B6%E9%8B%85%E9%81%BA%E5%9D%80%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":87774901,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87774901","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/513861bea04ba7cfa2c649ce.jpg","title":"重庆冶锌遗址群沙溪嘴遗址照片.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%86%B6%E9%94%8C%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E7%BE%A4%E6%B2%99%E6%BA%AA%E5%98%B4%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/%E9%87%8D%E5%BA%86%E5%86%B6%E9%94%8C%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E7%BE%A4%E6%B2%99%E6%BA%AA%E5%98%B4%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Shaxizui zinc metallurgy site in Fengdu County, Chongqing","width":320,"height":213}}